# Which files Cloudflare publishes as the website. Allow-list: everything at the top
# level is private unless it is re-included below, so tests, the Worker source,
# package files, .dev.vars and friends are never uploaded.
/*
!/index.html
!/movie.html
!/person.html
!/search.html
!/favorites.html
!/manifest.webmanifest
!/sw.js
!/scripts/
!/styles/
!/res/
